PhoneWindowManager: Let holding the power button turn the screen on and off

The Echo Shows' power button is also their privacy button. Their privacy
chip turns privacy on and off on any press shorter than about 3 seconds,
whatever Android does, and leaves it alone on a longer one. A short press
to turn the screen off or on therefore also turned privacy on or off.

LONG_PRESS_POWER_TOGGLE_SCREEN (7), set through power_button_long_press,
turns the screen off, or on when it is off, once the button has been
held for ro.config.long_press_power_screen_ms, 3200 by default, past the
chip's threshold. A press on a sleeping screen waits for it instead of
waking the screen at once, and Android does nothing on a short press, so
the short press only does what the chip does.

